
*** Live Steaming App ****

Video --TCP(RTMP)---- Transformation ---> MessageQueue  ---> Subscribers (Batch job runners) ---> Publish in a Message MessageQueue



Job of transformer is to take a very high quality video and convert it to various other streammable qualities (ex 720p/360p). This would be done by batch job
which would subscribe to a message queue which would be populated by transformation , once they are done they would send it to another queue and so on.


