*** Tinder ***


1) Storing profiles (5 images per profile)   2) Recommended matches   3) Liked Me     4) Direct Messaging 


While storing image question always is how to store using file (lower quality)/ blob (binary large object-- high quality). We prefer file way which stores images as objects in db and provides a url to get them. We can built a CDN over it which caches this URL and related image in edge servers


For messaging case , it is little unique because it's a client-client communication, client-server (server never initiases it only responds), so we use XMPP.
(Extensible Messaging and Presence Protocol) with a web-socket or TCP


For recomemndation we would have categories like age, gender etc . main issue is with location how to get people close to me we would need to shard our db 
based on location or use a NO-SQL db which provides it like casandra/dynamo.



